  "title": "Red Beet Eggs for a Crowd",
  "description": "This recipe for ruby-red pickled eggs and beets is easy to make because it uses canned beets. Just mix the ingredients and marinate hard-cooked eggs in your refrigerator for 1 to 3 days for a pretty and tasty side dish that serves a crowd.",
